\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Allometric scaling exponents and variance decomposition per eigenvalue mode. $\beta _{\rm  scale}$ is the IV-2SLS log--log coefficient of eigenvalue on isotropic scale, with HC-robust 95\,\% CIs and FDR-corrected $p$-values. $\Delta \lambda $ per IQR gives the percent eigenvalue change for an interquartile range shift in log-scale. R$^2$ columns show the LMG (Shapley) variance share for each predictor group.}}{10}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:allometry-summary}{{1}{10}{}{}{}}
